{"c":"433032","n":"OTAVA 7","t":"P","s":"ZČ","o":"Sušice 1","url":"433032-otava-7","stav":"2026-10-05","popis":"GPS Z: 49°16'3.522\"N, 13°35'40.786\"E, K: 49°11'19.966\"N, 13°29'24.97\"E\nPřítok Vltavy. Od mostu v obci Čepice (ř. km 84,8) až k jezu v Dlouhé Vsi (ř. km 99,8) včetně Chmelenského náhonu (GPS Z: 49°15'20.228\"N, 13°33'54.359\"E, K: 49°14'54.016\"N, 13°32'53.68\"E). Od jezu na Fufernách (ř. km 92,8) až k přepadu u Armádního domu, dále náhon na Pátečku (ř. km 95,4) a všechny přítoky jsou chovné – lov ryb zakázán. Na revíru mohou být vyznačena trdliště lipana podhorního (Thymallus thymallus). Na vyznačeném trdlišti je zákaz brodění od 16. 4. do 31. 5.","delka":14,"rozloha":17,"lat":49.228231,"lon":13.539542,"mo_web":"https://www.rybsvaz.cz/mo/-/susice-1","mo_tel":"606 739 445","mo_mail":"hanus.oz@seznam.cz","doba":[{"od":"2026-10-01","do":"2026-10-31","h":"07:00–19:00","zakaz":false}],"kratkodobe":[],"miry":[{"d":"Amur bílý","min":50,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-04-16","do":"2026-11-30","pozn":""},{"d":"Bolen dravý","min":null,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-04-16","do":"2026-11-30","pozn":"povinnost ponechat si"},{"d":"Candát obecný","min":null,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-04-16","do":"2026-11-30","pozn":""},{"d":"Cejn velký","min":null,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-04-16","do":"2026-11-30","pozn":""},{"d":"Hlavatka obecná","min":65,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-10-01","do":"2026-11-30","pozn":""},{"d":"Jelec jesen","min":null,"max":null,"hajen":true,"od":"2026-01-01","do":"2026-12-31","pozn":""},{"d":"Jelec tloušť","min":null,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-04-16","do":"2026-11-30","pozn":"povinnost ponechat si"},{"d":"Jeseter malý","min":30,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-04-16","do":"2026-11-30","pozn":""},{"d":"Kapr obecný","min":40,"max":70,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-04-16","do":"2026-11-30","pozn":""},{"d":"Lín obecný","min":20,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-04-16","do":"2026-11-30","pozn":""},{"d":"Lipan pod